### 10. QUALITY APPRAISAL FRAMEWORK GENERATION

Develop an AI-assisted quality appraisal planning engine.

Recommend appropriate appraisal instruments based on:

- Research design.
- Study type.
- Disciplinary context.
- Evidence characteristics.
- Review objectives.

Support appropriate instruments, including relevant JBI tools, CASP, MMAT, ROBINS-I, RoB 2, and other suitable tools.

Do not apply one appraisal instrument indiscriminately to all study designs.

Generate an appraisal planning matrix containing:

- Study design.
- Recommended appraisal instrument.
- Appraisal domains.
- Assessment criteria.
- Scoring or judgment approach.
- Researcher verification status.
- Methodological justification.

Distinguish between appraisal planning and completed study-level appraisal.

The AI may assist with appraisal but must not automatically present unverified judgments as final researcher assessments.

