### 12. PRISMA 2020 AND PRISMA-S REPORTING SUPPORT

Generate protocol-level reporting templates and checklists.

Support relevant PRISMA 2020 items and PRISMA-S search reporting requirements.

Provide:

- Reporting checklist.
- Protocol completion status.
- Search documentation.
- Eligibility documentation.
- Study selection planning.
- Planned extraction procedures.
- Planned synthesis methods.
- Reporting limitations.
- Missing information warnings.

Keep protocol-level planned procedures separate from completed review results.

The PRISMA flow diagram must use actual study identification, screening, exclusion, and inclusion records generated during the review.

Do not generate final PRISMA study counts from protocol assumptions.

