**FINAL DEVELOPMENT PRINCIPLE**

The Intelligent Systematic Review Protocol Builder must not simply generate text.

It must help researchers design, evaluate, validate, document, approve, and implement scientifically defensible systematic review protocols.

Its success must be measured by methodological consistency, scientific accuracy, transparency, reproducibility, practical usefulness, and seamless integration with the complete ResearchMate AI platform.